{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an electrifying 2D platform puzzle adventure in USB-BOT, where a small, disconnected USB sets out on a quest to reunite with the device it was once a part of. With its wire tail torn away, USB-BOT must navigate a world that suddenly feels immense and full of danger. As you traverse 2D environments filled with challenging puzzles and dynamic platforming elements, your mission is to help this determined little USB find its way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/grab_metal_framed_small.gif?t=1742976324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab, move, and use items in creative ways to conquer puzzles and platforming challenges. Grab metal objects and place them cleverly to complete circuits, power devices, and unlock new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/USBC_QR_framed_small.gif?t=1742976324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore freely, collect hidden QR code fragments, and piece them together to unlock new levels.\u00a0As an extra challenge, find and reunite scattered USBC-BOTS hidden in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/USB_framed_small.gif?t=1742976324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your head isn\u2019t just for thinking \u2014 it\u2019s part of the puzzle!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604130?t=1742976324","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604130?t=1742976324","capsule_image":"https://